Revision history for Uniform::HTMX::Mojolicious
1.02  2026-08-23
        - Refactored to use direct object-oriented inheritance
          from the Uniform::HTMX base package.
        - Replaced manual hash extraction loops in constructor with native
          SUPER::new() initialization pipelines.
        - Updated apply() methods to consume the native base class _out()
          internal accumulator rather than isolated local hashes.
1.01  2026-08-22
        - Added Links to POD
1.00  2026-08-22
        - Production-ready standalone Mojolicious ecosystem connector launch.
